[
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "In a cluttered workshop in Athens, the smell of sawdust hangs heavy in the air as a motley group of craftsmen gathers. Peter Quince, acting as the director, bustles about with a scroll in hand, while the others shuffle into place.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "scene setting",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.0,
    "start_s": 0.0,
    "end_s": 13.936327,
    "duration_s": 13.936327
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "text": "Is all our company here?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "fussy, checking",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 13.936327,
    "end_s": 15.516735,
    "duration_s": 1.580408
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "text": "You were best to call them generally, man by man, according to the scrip.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "authoritative, helpful",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 15.516735,
    "end_s": 19.892245000000003,
    "duration_s": 4.37551
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "text": "Here is the scroll of every man’s name, which is thought fit through all Athens, to play in our interlude before the Duke and Duchess, on his wedding-day at night.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "proud, official",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 19.892245000000003,
    "end_s": 28.813061000000005,
    "duration_s": 8.920816
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "text": "First, good Peter Quince, say what the play treats on; then read the names of the actors; and so grow to a point.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "taking charge, energetic",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 28.813061000000005,
    "end_s": 35.679728000000004,
    "duration_s": 6.866667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 5,
    "text": "Marry, our play is The most lamentable comedy and most cruel death of Pyramus and Thisbe.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "formal announcement",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 35.679728000000004,
    "end_s": 41.335238000000004,
    "duration_s": 5.65551
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 6,
    "text": "A very good piece of work, I assure you, and a merry. Now, good Peter Quince, call forth your actors by the scroll. Masters, spread yourselves.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "approving, commanding",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 41.335238000000004,
    "end_s": 51.091973,
    "duration_s": 9.756735
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 7,
    "text": "Quince clears his throat, ready to address the group, but Bottom gestures for the others to give him space.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "neutral",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.0,
    "start_s": 51.091973,
    "end_s": 57.171973,
    "duration_s": 6.08
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 8,
    "text": "Answer, as I call you. Nick Bottom, the weaver.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "calling roll",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 57.171973,
    "end_s": 61.103402,
    "duration_s": 3.931429
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 9,
    "text": "Ready. Name what part I am for, and proceed.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "eager, prompt",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 61.103402,
    "end_s": 64.01605500000001,
    "duration_s": 2.912653
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 10,
    "text": "You, Nick Bottom, are set down for Pyramus.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "informative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 64.01605500000001,
    "end_s": 67.29442200000001,
    "duration_s": 3.278367
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 11,
    "text": "What is Pyramus—a lover, or a tyrant?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "curious, dramatic",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 67.29442200000001,
    "end_s": 70.41605500000001,
    "duration_s": 3.121633
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 12,
    "text": "A lover, that kills himself most gallantly for love.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "explanatory",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 70.41605500000001,
    "end_s": 73.84272200000001,
    "duration_s": 3.426667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 13,
    "text": "That will ask some tears in the true performing of it. If I do it, let the audience look to their eyes. I will move storms; I will condole in some measure.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "grand, boasting",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 73.84272200000001,
    "end_s": 83.41660000000002,
    "duration_s": 9.573878
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 14,
    "text": "To the rest—yet my chief humour is for a tyrant. I could play Ercles rarely, or a part to tear a cat in, to make all split.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "confident, loud",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 83.41660000000002,
    "end_s": 92.44190600000002,
    "duration_s": 9.025306
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 15,
    "text": "Bottom strikes a dramatic pose, raising his voice to demonstrate his tyrannical acting style.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "neutral",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.0,
    "start_s": 92.44190600000002,
    "end_s": 97.64190600000002,
    "duration_s": 5.2
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 16,
    "text": "The raging rocks, And shivering shocks, Shall break the locks, Of prison gates, And Phibbus’ car, Shall shine from far, And make and mar, The foolish Fates.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "overacting, booming, rhythmic",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 97.64190600000002,
    "end_s": 109.43619200000002,
    "duration_s": 11.794286
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 17,
    "text": "This was lofty. Now name the rest of the players. This is Ercles’ vein, a tyrant’s vein; a lover is more condoling.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "self-satisfied, critical",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 109.43619200000002,
    "end_s": 117.39047800000002,
    "duration_s": 7.954286
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 18,
    "text": "Francis Flute, the bellows-mender.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "calling roll",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 117.39047800000002,
    "end_s": 119.75456000000001,
    "duration_s": 2.364082
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FLUTE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 19,
    "text": "Here, Peter Quince.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "high-pitched, youthful",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 119.75456000000001,
    "end_s": 121.46122700000001,
    "duration_s": 1.706667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 20,
    "text": "Flute, you must take Thisbe on you.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "instructive",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 121.46122700000001,
    "end_s": 124.24326800000001,
    "duration_s": 2.782041
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FLUTE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 21,
    "text": "What is Thisbe? A wandering knight?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "hopeful, confused",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 124.24326800000001,
    "end_s": 127.07755400000002,
    "duration_s": 2.834286
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 22,
    "text": "It is the lady that Pyramus must love.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "patient",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 127.07755400000002,
    "end_s": 129.258778,
    "duration_s": 2.181224
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FLUTE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 23,
    "text": "Nay, faith, let not me play a woman. I have a beard coming.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "whining, protesting",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 129.258778,
    "end_s": 133.24245100000002,
    "duration_s": 3.983673
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 24,
    "text": "That’s all one. You shall play it in a mask, and you may speak as small as you will.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "dismissive, practical",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 133.24245100000002,
    "end_s": 137.826941,
    "duration_s": 4.58449
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 25,
    "text": "Bottom steps in again, eager to seize another role.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "neutral",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.0,
    "start_s": 137.826941,
    "end_s": 140.706941,
    "duration_s": 2.88
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 26,
    "text": "And I may hide my face, let me play Thisbe too. I’ll speak in a monstrous little voice; ‘Thisne, Thisne!’—‘Ah, Pyramus, my lover dear! thy Thisbe dear! and lady dear!’",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "falsetto, comedic, demonstrating",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 140.706941,
    "end_s": 151.933562,
    "duration_s": 11.226621
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 27,
    "text": "No, no, you must play Pyramus; and, Flute, you Thisbe.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "firm, exasperated",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 151.933562,
    "end_s": 156.256827,
    "duration_s": 4.323265
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 28,
    "text": "Well, proceed.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "relenting",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 156.256827,
    "end_s": 157.628256,
    "duration_s": 1.371429
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 29,
    "text": "Robin Starveling, the tailor.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "calling roll",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 157.628256,
    "end_s": 159.60050099999998,
    "duration_s": 1.972245
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "STARVELING",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 30,
    "text": "Here, Peter Quince.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "timid, quiet",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 159.60050099999998,
    "end_s": 160.90768899999998,
    "duration_s": 1.307188
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 31,
    "text": "Robin Starveling, you must play Thisbe’s mother. Tom Snout, the tinker.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "organizing",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 160.90768899999998,
    "end_s": 165.46605599999998,
    "duration_s": 4.558367
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "SNOUT",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 32,
    "text": "Here, Peter Quince.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "gruff",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 165.46605599999998,
    "end_s": 167.332723,
    "duration_s": 1.866667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 33,
    "text": "You, Pyramus’ father; myself, Thisbe’s father; Snug, the joiner, you, the lion’s part. And, I hope here is a play fitted.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "satisfied, wrapping up",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 167.332723,
    "end_s": 175.91394699999998,
    "duration_s": 8.581224
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "SNUG",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 34,
    "text": "Have you the lion’s part written? Pray you, if it be, give it me, for I am slow of study.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "anxious, slow",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 175.91394699999998,
    "end_s": 182.01353899999998,
    "duration_s": 6.099592
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 35,
    "text": "You may do it extempore, for it is nothing but roaring.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "reassuring",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 182.01353899999998,
    "end_s": 184.95231499999997,
    "duration_s": 2.938776
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 36,
    "text": "Let me play the lion too. I will roar that I will do any man’s heart good to hear me. I will roar that I will make the Duke say ‘Let him roar again, let him roar again.’",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "enthusiastic, interrupting",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 184.95231499999997,
    "end_s": 194.94415199999997,
    "duration_s": 9.991837
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 37,
    "text": "If you should do it too terribly, you would fright the Duchess and the ladies, that they would shriek; and that were enough to hang us all.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "warning, serious",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 194.94415199999997,
    "end_s": 201.65081899999998,
    "duration_s": 6.706667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 38,
    "text": "The craftsmen exchange horrified glances and cry out in unison.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "neutral",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.0,
    "start_s": 201.65081899999998,
    "end_s": 205.29081899999997,
    "duration_s": 3.64
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 39,
    "text": "\"That would hang us every mother’s son.\"",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "terrified, unison",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 205.29081899999997,
    "end_s": 207.52428799999998,
    "duration_s": 2.233469
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 40,
    "text": "I grant you, friends, if you should fright the ladies out of their wits, they would have no more discretion but to hang us.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "conceding, reasonable",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 207.52428799999998,
    "end_s": 214.09408399999998,
    "duration_s": 6.569796
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 41,
    "text": "But I will aggravate my voice so, that I will roar you as gently as any sucking dove; I will roar you an ’twere any nightingale.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "persuasive, soft",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 214.09408399999998,
    "end_s": 221.57816599999998,
    "duration_s": 7.484082
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 42,
    "text": "You can play no part but Pyramus, for Pyramus is a sweet-faced man; a proper man as one shall see in a summer’s day; a most lovely gentleman-like man. Therefore you must needs play Pyramus.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "flattering, insistent",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 221.57816599999998,
    "end_s": 233.659799,
    "duration_s": 12.081633
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 43,
    "text": "Well, I will undertake it. What beard were I best to play it in?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "accepting, vain",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 233.659799,
    "end_s": 237.61735,
    "duration_s": 3.957551
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 44,
    "text": "Why, what you will.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "indifferent",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 237.61735,
    "end_s": 238.85816599999998,
    "duration_s": 1.240816
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 45,
    "text": "I will discharge it in either your straw-colour beard, your orange-tawny beard, your purple-in-grain beard, or your French-crown-colour beard, your perfect yellow.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "listing, pondering",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 238.85816599999998,
    "end_s": 249.29408399999997,
    "duration_s": 10.435918
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 46,
    "text": "Some of your French crowns have no hair at all, and then you will play bare-faced.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "wry, sharp",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 249.29408399999997,
    "end_s": 253.74796199999997,
    "duration_s": 4.453878
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 47,
    "text": "But, masters, here are your parts, and I am to entreat you, request you, and desire you, to con them by tomorrow night; and meet me in the palace wood, a mile without the town, by moonlight.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "authoritative, planning",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 253.74796199999997,
    "end_s": 265.88183999999995,
    "duration_s": 12.133878
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 48,
    "text": "There will we rehearse, for if we meet in the city, we shall be dogg’d with company, and our devices known. In the meantime I will draw a bill of properties, such as our play wants. I pray you fail me not.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "serious, concluding",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 265.88183999999995,
    "end_s": 278.17245199999996,
    "duration_s": 12.290612
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "BOTTOM",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 49,
    "text": "We will meet, and there we may rehearse most obscenely and courageously. Take pains, be perfect; adieu.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "grand, confident",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 278.17245199999996,
    "end_s": 285.029595,
    "duration_s": 6.857143
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "QUINCE",
    "scene_identifier": "QUINCE_WORKSHOP",
    "ordinal": 50,
    "text": "At the Duke’s oak we meet.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "confirming",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 285.029595,
    "end_s": 286.47939099999996,
    "duration_s": 1.449796
  },
  {
